              "text": "Section 10.14 Insurance. Cellco, in each of its capacities as Servicer, Marketing Agent and Custodian, will maintain, at its own expense, throughout the term of this Agreement and for one (1) year thereafter: (a) commercial general liability insurance of not less than $1,000,000 per occurrence and $2,000,000 in the aggregate; (b) professional liability (errors and omissions) insurance of not less than $2,000,000; (c) cyber liability insurance of not less than $5,000,000 covering its handling of the Receivable Files and any Personally Identifiable Information of the Obligors; and (d) workers' compensation insurance as required by applicable Law. Cellco will provide certificates of insurance to the Issuer and the Depositor on request."
